> REVIEW: Unspecified amount: Salt only if needed

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @dry gluten-free rigatoni or cavatappi{12/5%oz}, @cremini mushrooms{1/5%lb} (sliced), @medium leeks{2/5} (cleaned + sliced), @olive oil{3/5%tbsp}, @butter{3/5%tbsp}, @garlic cloves{3/5} (minced), @certified gluten-free white miso{2/5%tbsp}, @Parmesan{1/10%cup} (grated), @sherry vinegar{2/5%tbsp}, @reserved gluten-free pasta water{3/20%cup}, @parsley{1/20%cup} (chopped), @black pepper{1/10%tsp}, @Salt only if needed{}.

== Preparation ==

Cook gluten-free pasta and reserve cooking water. Brown mushrooms in oil and butter, soften the leeks and garlic, then stir in miso loosened with reserved water. Toss with pasta, Parmesan and vinegar; finish with parsley and pepper.
